WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.500
A sheet of paper falls on the sea, and the characters on it come alive.

2
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:12.200
Gather wood. Lay bricks. Write yourself a home.

3
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:19.300
From the 13th night, the spirits walk. Light a lamp and hold out until dawn.

4
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:23.400
Live by the solar terms: snow,

5
00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.300
thunder, wind and rain.

6
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.300
Sow the five grains and watch them grow, stroke by stroke.

7
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:40.000
At night, look up and learn the stars.

8
00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:44.300
When your courage is enough, build a boat and cross the sea.

9
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:50.000
Find Gonggong, who tilted the world.

10
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.600
Coming to Steam
